Description: Web panel "VLESS на роутере" for OpenWrt (uhttpd :8088).
 Toggle transparent proxy, test connection and speed, save vless://,
 hysteria2://, naive+https:// links and a WireGuard .conf. Requires a
 manually installed xray binary in /usr/bin and geoip/geosite in
 /usr/share/xray. hysteria and naive binaries are optional; install
 naive with /usr/libexec/vless-panel/install-naive.sh.
